    each element of ``x``, promoting to inexact dtype.

  Note:
    - ``jnp.arcsinh`` returns ``nan`` for values outside the range ``(-inf, inf)``.
    - ``jnp.arcsinh`` follows the branch cut convention of :obj:`numpy.arcsinh`
      for complex inputs.

